    "Footnote 3 is supplied in da12aecad4e68.u30.3569. The XML and web-form claims' missing-footnote uncertainties are stale. The XML permission is supported as a listed method, but its extracted conditions omit the required e-Cert; they must not be read as sufficient conditions for compliance.",
